      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "First choose a sound in the Main Input panel on the left, under Audio: a microphone, a Sound file, or System audio (what you hear). Bass grows the red circle, Mid the green and High the blue, and Layer Blend adds them, so where they overlap the colors mix as light does: yellow, cyan, magenta, white in the middle. A bass line turns the picture red; a cymbal, blue."
        }
